<Project Sdk="Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0">
 <PropertyGroup>
  <Version>0.1.0.10</Version><Author>CheesyChiz</Author><Name>XIVGear Prog</Name><InternalName>XivGearProg</InternalName>
  <Punchline>Sync equipped gear and saved gear sets with XIVGear Prog.</Punchline>
  <Description>Connect your account using a revocable token. Sends your equipped gear and saved combat gear sets, including materia and relic stats, to xivgearprog.top. Syncs all unlocked combat job levels so the website recommends equippable gear and calculates at the correct level. Includes gear in bags and Armoury Chest. Includes currency and material balances. Prices are provided by the website server from Garland Tools. Use one token for multiple characters; select a character on the website. Retainer inventory snapshots update only after opening their inventories in game. Choose which jobs and individual gear sets to sync in /xgp. Open /xgp to connect; automatic checks run every 5 minutes and only changed data is sent. Use Sync now for an immediate update.</Description>
  <RepoUrl>https://github.com/CheesyChiz/DalamudPlugins/tree/main/src/XivGearProg</RepoUrl>
  <IconUrl>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CheesyChiz/DalamudPlugins/main/src/XivGearProg/assets/icon.png</IconUrl>
  <Tags>gear;gearsets;xivgear;sync</Tags><PackageLicenseExpression>AGPL-3.0-only</PackageLicenseExpression>
  <Nullable>enable</Nullable><ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings><AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
 </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
